Subject: [PATCH] ICE increment 4c: repoint emergency lookup to event-scoped
 ICE + drop profile health columns

- TrackingMap renderEmergency: source blood type/allergies/ICE contact from the event roster (adds Allergies; drops age/country/relation lines)
- migration 041: get_participant_emergency() returns event_participants ICE + non-health identity from the linked account; then drops profiles.blood_type + emergency_contact_name/phone/relation

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
